OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' recovery from sepsis
OL,4,Acaused by a roast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Surrey who was given just
OL,7,Fhours to live after a roast dinner led
OL,8,Fto him developing sepsis said he has
OL,9,Fbeen given a "second chance" at life.
OL,11,FUdhyam Amin, from Kingswood, spent a
OL,12,Flittle over two weeks in an induced
OL,13,Fcoma back in February after what he
OL,14,Fthought was food poisoning turned out
OL,15,Fto be sepsis.
OL,17,FAhead of World Sepsis Day on Sunday,
OL,18,Fthe 64-year-old, now back at work,
OL,19,Ffeels indebted to the medical team at
OL,20,FSt Helier Hospital in south London.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
